     # --scale=2 renders the 1920x1080 comps at true 3840x2160 (supersampled text).
     # --image-format=png removes Remotion's default JPEG-q80 frame step (the hidden
     # quality ceiling on flat brand color + text). --crf=16 for a clean master.
+    # --timeout raises the delayRender ceiling from Remotion's 30s default. This was
+    # an attempt at the long-standing intermittent failure
+    #   "Could not find composition with ID <X>. Available compositions: CodexComposerAsk"
+    # (CodexComposerAsk is merely the FIRST composition registered in Root.tsx, so
+    # Remotion appears to be reading a PARTIAL composition snapshot). Tested
+    # 2026-08-03: the flag does NOT eliminate it — beats still fail and then succeed
+    # on retry with the flag in place. Kept because a higher ceiling is harmless for
+    # a 600-composition Root, but the cause is still UNDIAGNOSED and callers must
+    # keep retrying. Do not remove the retry logic on the strength of this flag.
     cmd = ["npx", "remotion", "render", ENTRY, pattern, str(out.resolve()),
-           f"--props={props_path}", "--concurrency=1",
+           f"--props={props_path}", "--concurrency=1", "--timeout=180000",
            "--scale=2", "--image-format=png", "--crf=16"] + browser_flags()
